title: 'lavHelper: Helper Functions for lavaan Models'
version: 0.0.2
abstract: Helper functions for 'lavaan' models. The functions convert between 'lavaan'
  model matrices and reticular action model (RAM) matrices, compute the standardized
  solution from RAM matrices, and extract the parameter estimates of a fitted model
  including fixed parameters, defined parameters, and equality and inequality constraints.
